      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "attr",
      "line": 6,
      "zh": "五子棋网页版：15×15 标准棋盘，三档电脑 AI、双人对弈，可选连珠禁手（三三、四四、长连），支持悔棋、提示、显示手数，连成五子发光庆祝，打开即玩。",
      "en": "Gomoku online: standard 15x15 board, three AI levels, two-player mode, optional Renju forbidden moves (double-three, double-four, overline), undo, hints, move numbers and a glowing five-in-a-row celebration. Play instantly."
    },
