    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 101,
      "zh": "💡 提示会用绿色光圈标出推荐落点",
      "en": "💡 Hints mark the suggested point with a green ring"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 102,
      "zh": "静音",
      "en": "mute"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 102,
      "zh": "红点标记最后一手",
      "en": "The red dot marks the last move"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 104,
      "zh": "📖 棋形图鉴",
      "en": "📖 Shapes"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 106,
      "zh": "连五：同色五子连成一线，立即获胜",
      "en": "Five: five in a line — instant win"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 107,
      "zh": "活四：两端都空的四子，对方再也堵不住",
      "en": "Open four: four with both ends open — unstoppable"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 108,
      "zh": "冲四：只差一子成五，对方必须马上堵",
      "en": "Four: one move from five — must be blocked now"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 109,
      "zh": "活三：两端开放的三子，下一步可成活四",
      "en": "Open three: three with open ends, becomes an open four next move"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 110,
      "zh": "禁手（仅黑方）：三三、四四、长连（六子以上）都算犯规",
      "en": "Forbidden (Black only): double-three, double-four and overlines (6+)"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 113,
      "zh": "🧠 对弈秘诀",
      "en": "🧠 Strategy Tips"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 114,
      "zh": "黑棋先手有优势，所以连珠规则给黑方加了禁手。进攻时制造“四三”——一步同时形成冲四和活三，对方只能堵一个。防守时先堵对方的活三，再看冲四。开局别离天元太远，棋子越集中，连线机会越多。",
      "en": "Black moves first and has the edge, which is why Renju gives Black forbidden moves. Attack with a \"four-three\": one move making a four and an open three at once — your opponent can only block one. On defense, stop open threes before they grow. Stay near the center early: the closer your stones, the more lines you threaten."
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 118,
      "zh": "📖 关于这款游戏",
      "en": "📖 About this game"
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 118,
      "zh": "五子棋网页版使用 15×15 标准棋盘，黑先白后，横、竖、斜任一方向先连成五子者获胜。人机模式提供入门、进阶、大师三档 AI，采用五元组评估与 Alpha-Beta 迭代加深搜索，会进攻也会防守；双人模式可以和朋友同屏对弈。可选连珠禁手规则（黑方三三、四四、长连判负手），界面会标出禁手点。支持执黑或执白、悔棋、落点提示、显示手数、落子动画和五连发光庆祝，完全免费。",
      "en": "Gomoku online on a standard 15×15 board: Black moves first, and the first to get five in a row horizontally, vertically or diagonally wins. Play the computer at Beginner, Advanced or Master — the AI uses five-tuple evaluation with iterative-deepening alpha-beta search and both attacks and defends — or play a friend on the same screen. Optional Renju rules forbid Black's double-threes, double-fours and overlines, with forbidden points marked on the board. Play Black or White, undo, ask for hints, show move numbers, and enjoy stone-drop animations and a glowing five-in-a-row celebration."
    },
    {
      "file": "index.html",
      "kind": "text",
      "line": 119,
      "zh": "🕹️ 打开即玩 · 完全免费 · 人机 / 双人",
      "en": "🕹️ Play instantly · Free · vs AI / 2P"
    },
